- If you want to restrict *which* users can log in at all, add `settings.AllowUsers = "alice bob";`.
- Test with a second session open before switching, so a misconfigured key doesn't lock you out.
- After `nixos-rebuild switch`, verify with `sshd -T | grep -E 'passwordauthentication|pubkeyauthentication'` (run as root) to confirm the effective settings.

